  "description": "Two lines in opposite corners, and two passers (D1 and D2) up near the blue line. The first skater passes to D1, then skates out around D1. D1 passes across to D2, and D2 passes to the skater coming through the middle, who shoots. The shooter joins the other corner's line, and the next skater goes from that corner.",
